                <pb facs="0363" n="279" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg279"/>

                <head>No. 131.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram from President of Ecuador to
                        Ecuadorian minister, dated <date calendar="gregorian" when="1885-06-24">24th
                            June, 1885</date>, and shown to Mr. Bayard by Señor Flores, 25th June,
                        1885.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have decided to ask from Congress pardon, in order to save Santos. Suspend
                    everything and answer.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
